WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:03.634
Welcome, everybody. Welcome,
welcome to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:03.634 --> 00:00:05.501
You're here.
Thank you for watching.

00:00:05.501 --> 00:00:07.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:07.701 --> 00:00:10.000
Today is March 1st, which means

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.501
it is the start
of Women's History Month.

00:00:12.501 --> 00:00:14.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.334 --> 00:00:17.167
Exactly right. Yeah.

00:00:17.167 --> 00:00:19.334
Just remember --
behind every great woman

00:00:19.334 --> 00:00:23.267
is a man loudly repeating
her ideas.

00:00:23.267 --> 00:00:25.000
Let's get to some news.
Today, in Washington,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.334
the Conservative Political
Action Conference, or CPAC,

00:00:28.334 --> 00:00:30.901
kicked off.
It's basically Coachella

00:00:30.901 --> 00:00:35.067
for people who post on Facebook
in all caps.

00:00:35.067 --> 00:00:37.100
I heard that this year
top Republicans

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:38.934
like Ron DeSantis
and Mitch McConnell

00:00:38.934 --> 00:00:40.467
aren't attending CPAC.

00:00:40.467 --> 00:00:42.734
[ Audience "oohs" ]
Yeah.

00:00:42.734 --> 00:00:44.133
It's being held in D.C.

00:00:44.133 --> 00:00:47.434
at the Gaylord National Resort
and Convention Center.

00:00:47.434 --> 00:00:48.634
Now --

00:00:48.634 --> 00:00:50.634
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.634 --> 00:00:52.801
Now we know Mike Pence
won't be there, either.

00:00:52.801 --> 00:00:54.400
I don't think...

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:57.234
CPAC calls itself the largest
and most influential

00:00:57.234 --> 00:00:59.234
gathering of conservatives
in the world.

00:00:59.234 --> 00:01:02.200
The speeches will be serious,
while the people trying to dance

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:04.400
at the after-party
will be hilarious.

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:06.968
♪♪

00:01:06.968 --> 00:01:08.767
But this is nice.

00:01:08.767 --> 00:01:10.667
After each speech,
there will be a QAnon.

00:01:10.667 --> 00:01:12.968
Uh, sorry. Q&amp;A. Q&amp;A.

00:01:12.968 --> 00:01:15.200
After --
There'll be a Q&amp;A.

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:16.534
Did you guys hear about this?

00:01:16.534 --> 00:01:18.834
A few days ago,
when First Lady Jill Biden

00:01:18.834 --> 00:01:20.901
was flying back
from a trip to Kenya,

00:01:20.901 --> 00:01:23.200
the plane stopped to refuel
in Italy,

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:25.200
and she ordered 19 pizzas.

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:27.334
-Man!

00:01:27.334 --> 00:01:30.534
-So, apparently, weed is legal
on "Air Force One."

00:01:30.534 --> 00:01:33.534
I -- That's interesting.

00:01:33.534 --> 00:01:35.000
She was gonna order 20 pizzas,

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:37.200
but she didn't want
to overdo it, yeah.

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:39.801
Then she needed beer,
so they stopped in Germany.

00:01:39.801 --> 00:01:41.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.267
People are talking about this.

00:01:42.267 --> 00:01:44.901
Apparently, King Charles
is evicting Harry and Meghan

00:01:44.901 --> 00:01:46.801
from their royal residence
in the U.K.

00:01:46.801 --> 00:01:48.334
[ Audience "oohs" ]

00:01:48.334 --> 00:01:50.033
It's a tough break
for Harry and Meghan.

00:01:50.033 --> 00:01:51.567
Nothing hurts more
than getting evicted

00:01:51.567 --> 00:01:55.234
three years after you move out.
You know what I'm saying?

00:01:55.234 --> 00:01:56.601
Some TV news.

00:01:56.601 --> 00:01:59.501
Today, the third season of
"The Mandalorian" premiered.

00:01:59.501 --> 00:02:00.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:00.701 --> 00:02:03.801
And, uh -- Yeah. Love that.

00:02:03.801 --> 00:02:05.701
You can tell Baby Yoda's
gotten super famous because

00:02:05.701 --> 00:02:08.667
in this one he just keeps
plugging his tequila brand.

00:02:08.667 --> 00:02:11.467
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.467 --> 00:02:14.200
That's right. The new season of
"The Mandalorian" is here.

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:16.868
That's right. Fans have been
waiting over two years.

00:02:16.868 --> 00:02:18.300
And as a special treat,

00:02:18.300 --> 00:02:20.534
Disney Plus announced
a new spinoff series.

00:02:20.534 --> 00:02:22.767
-Oh.
-Yeah. Check this out. Yeah.

00:02:22.767 --> 00:02:25.100
-Stay tuned
after "The Mandalorian"

00:02:25.100 --> 00:02:26.968
for the all-new spinoff...

00:02:26.968 --> 00:02:28.667
"Cocaine Baby Yoda."

00:02:28.667 --> 00:02:30.300
-He-he-he!

00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:32.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.667 --> 00:02:34.100
-What?!

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:35.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:35.968 --> 00:02:38.701
-Come on.

00:02:38.701 --> 00:02:40.334
-I'll watch it.

00:02:40.334 --> 00:02:41.734
Well, get this.

00:02:41.734 --> 00:02:43.534
Today, Netflix said
that later this year

00:02:43.534 --> 00:02:46.868
they're premiering
a "Stranger Things" play.

00:02:46.868 --> 00:02:49.634
Right now, a team of
choreographers is hard at work

00:02:49.634 --> 00:02:52.067
teaching a Demogorgon
how to jazz-hands.

00:02:52.067 --> 00:02:53.567
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.567 --> 00:02:54.934
♪♪

00:02:54.934 --> 00:02:56.467
It's an interesting play.

00:02:56.467 --> 00:02:58.267
After every ten minutes,
an actor asks,

00:02:58.267 --> 00:03:00.400
"Are you still watching?"

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:03.200
Hey, I saw that the release of
"The Super Mario Brothers Movie"

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:04.767
had been moved up by two days.

00:03:04.767 --> 00:03:06.100
-Oh.

00:03:06.100 --> 00:03:08.267
-In other words, yeah,
the film's producers heard...

00:03:08.267 --> 00:03:10.267
[ Mario coin jingles ]

00:03:10.267 --> 00:03:11.534
And they realized
it could be a...

00:03:11.534 --> 00:03:13.100
[ Mario 1-Up sound ]

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:14.934
So they took
Mario's release date and...

00:03:14.934 --> 00:03:16.367
[ Mario power-up sound ]

00:03:16.367 --> 00:03:18.667
Which means the other movies
that come out that week are...

00:03:18.667 --> 00:03:20.834
[ "Mario dies" sound effect ]

00:03:20.834 --> 00:03:22.767
[ Applause ]

00:03:26.868 --> 00:03:28.334
Well, listen to this.

00:03:28.334 --> 00:03:30.000
Busch Gardens in Tampa
just opened

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:32.901
one of the world's tallest
and fastest rides.

00:03:32.901 --> 00:03:34.300
Can we see it?

00:03:34.300 --> 00:03:36.300
-Ooh.
[ Audience "oohs" ]

00:03:36.300 --> 00:03:38.834
-Looks like how
my daughter draws me.

00:03:38.834 --> 00:03:41.801
[ Laughter ]

00:03:41.801 --> 00:03:44.367
Yeah, it's called
the Serengeti Flyer.

00:03:44.367 --> 00:03:45.834
You may know it
by its other name,

00:03:45.834 --> 00:03:47.400
The Cellphone Catapult.

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:49.000
It's like --
"Oh, why didn't I...?"

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:53.534
I'm not sure I trust the world's
fastest ride at Busch Gardens.

00:03:53.534 --> 00:03:56.300
It's like hearing the world's
fastest car is built by Kia.

00:03:56.300 --> 00:03:58.167
You go, "Well..."

00:03:58.167 --> 00:04:00.367
And finally, do you
ever see a photo in the news

00:04:00.367 --> 00:04:01.801
and think the headline
should be different?

00:04:01.801 --> 00:04:03.834
Well, I'll show you. We'll
take care of that right now.

00:04:03.834 --> 00:04:05.033
It's time for
"News &amp; Improved."

00:04:05.033 --> 00:04:06.534
Here we go.

00:04:06.534 --> 00:04:11.968
-♪ News and improved ♪

00:04:11.968 --> 00:04:13.834
-The headline could be better.
-Sure.

00:04:13.834 --> 00:04:15.701
-Let me give you an example.
This first photo here.

00:04:15.701 --> 00:04:18.968
The original headline was...

00:04:18.968 --> 00:04:20.734
That headline can
definitely be improved.

00:04:20.734 --> 00:04:22.467
Because if you only
looked at the photo,

00:04:22.467 --> 00:04:25.501
the headline could have been...

00:04:25.501 --> 00:04:27.367
-Aww.

00:04:27.367 --> 00:04:31.100
[ Applause ]

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:35.300
-Up next, this headline says...

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:38.901
Headline could have been...

00:04:38.901 --> 00:04:41.300
It's like, "Oh. Sorry!

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:44.100
I didn't see anything."

00:04:44.100 --> 00:04:48.634
Next headline was...

00:04:48.634 --> 00:04:52.400
Headline could have been...

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:55.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:55.067 --> 00:04:58.667
"I'm gonna go see 'Avatar.'"

00:04:58.667 --> 00:05:02.234
Next headline was...

00:05:02.234 --> 00:05:04.300
Headline could have been...

00:05:08.267 --> 00:05:10.467
"No specials because
everything here is a special?"

00:05:10.467 --> 00:05:13.901
[ Laughs hysterically ]

00:05:13.901 --> 00:05:16.033
Next headline was...

00:05:19.033 --> 00:05:22.567
Headline could have been...

00:05:22.567 --> 00:05:25.501
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:25.501 --> 00:05:28.000
♪♪

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:31.501
Next headline was...

00:05:31.501 --> 00:05:34.667
Headline could have been...

00:05:34.667 --> 00:05:37.934
-Oh. Wow.

00:05:37.934 --> 00:05:40.667
[ Applause ]

00:05:40.667 --> 00:05:44.501
-Next headline was...

00:05:44.501 --> 00:05:46.300
Headline could have been...

00:05:49.100 --> 00:05:53.400
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:53.400 --> 00:05:56.868
The next headline was...

00:05:56.868 --> 00:06:00.868
Headline could have been...

00:06:00.868 --> 00:06:03.801
"Oh! Curry, over here!
Steph, Steph! Right here, man!"

00:06:03.801 --> 00:06:05.968
[ Applause ]

00:06:05.968 --> 00:06:11.033
And, finally,
this headline was...

00:06:11.033 --> 00:06:14.300
Headline could have been...

